{"schema_version":"1.0.0","id":"cik-0002030781","cik":"0002030781","slug":"sailpoint-030781","name":"SailPoint, Inc.","ticker":"SAIL","exchanges":["Nasdaq"],"sector":"Services-Prepackaged Software","sic":"7372","country":"TX","website":"","listed_years":1.3,"first_annual":"2025-03-27","last_filing":"2026-07-09","annual_only":false,"edgar_url":"https://www.sec.gov/cgi-bin/browse-edgar?action=getcompany&CIK=0002030781&type=10-K","summary":{"sentences":["SailPoint, Inc. files with the SEC under \"Services-Prepackaged Software\", based in TX, and has been publicly reporting for 1 year.","It reported $1.1bn of revenue over the trailing four quarters, up 21.6% against the same quarter a year earlier, at a gross margin of 64.7%.","Listed on Nasdaq, it is still consuming cash, with roughly 41 months of runway at the current burn."],"generated":true,"note":"Assembled from filing metadata and XBRL figures. Not editorial judgement - and rule 7 asks whether *you* can explain it, so rewrite this in your own words before you rely on it."},"bull":[{"text":"Revenue grew 21.6% year on year (Q1 2026 vs Q1 2025), reaching $280.1m in the quarter.","source_url":"https://www.sec.gov/Archives/edgar/data/2030781/000203078126000011/0002030781-26-000011-index.htm","accession":"0002030781-26-000011"},{"text":"Growth has been positive in all 4 year-on-year comparisons, so this is a trend rather than one good quarter.","source_url":"https://www.sec.gov/Archives/edgar/data/2030781/000203078126000011/0002030781-26-000011-index.htm","accession":"0002030781-26-000011"},{"text":"Gross margin of 64.7% means most of each additional sale falls through to cover fixed costs.","source_url":"https://www.sec.gov/Archives/edgar/data/2030781/000203078126000011/0002030781-26-000011-index.htm","accession":"0002030781-26-000011"},{"text":"Gross margin expanded from 55.4% to 64.7% against the same quarter a year earlier - the company is keeping more of what it sells, not buying growth with discounts.","source_url":"https://www.sec.gov/Archives/edgar/data/2030781/000203078126000011/0002030781-26-000011-index.htm","accession":"0002030781-26-000011"},{"text":"Net cash of $390.8m against total assets of $7.5bn - no debt overhang forcing decisions.","source_url":"https://www.sec.gov/Archives/edgar/data/2030781/000203078126000011/0002030781-26-000011-index.htm","accession":"0002030781-26-000011"}],"bear":[{"text":"The company is loss-making at the operating line (-28.5% margin). Profitability is a forecast, not a fact.","source_url":"https://www.sec.gov/Archives/edgar/data/2030781/000203078126000011/0002030781-26-000011-index.htm","accession":"0002030781-26-000011"},{"text":"Diluted share count rose 12.9% over the year (Q1 2026 vs Q1 2025). The company can grow while your share of it shrinks, and this is the number most commentary ignores.","source_url":"https://www.sec.gov/Archives/edgar/data/2030781/000203078126000011/0002030781-26-000011-index.htm","accession":"0002030781-26-000011"},{"text":"Only 7 quarters of reported history. There is no track record here to speak of, and a short series flatters whatever the recent trend happens to be.","source_url":"https://www.sec.gov/cgi-bin/browse-edgar?action=getcompany&CIK=0002030781"},{"text":"Insiders disposed of 3.1% of their combined holdings over the last four quarters (504,668 shares across 14 ownership filings). People with the best view of the business were reducing their stake.","source_url":"https://www.sec.gov/Archives/edgar/data/2030781/000172249826000028/0001722498-26-000028-index.htm"},{"text":"Base rate: 57.8% of US common stocks underperformed one-month Treasury bills over their lifetimes (Bessembinder, Journal of Financial Economics, 2018). Nothing above changes that starting point.","source_url":"https://doi.org/10.1016/j.jfineco.2018.06.004"}],"triggers":[{"id":"gross_margin_floor","kind":"metric","label":"Gross margin falls below 57.0% for 2 consecutive quarters","metric":"gross_margin","comparison":"below","thresh